Package: AutoCDAScorer
Title: Automatically Score Cell Death Areas in Agroinfiltration Images
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Joshua", "Williams", , "joshuandwilliams@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Scores cell death areas (CDAs) in UV agroinfiltration images of
    Nicotiana benthamiana leaves. Deep learning and ordinal regression models
    give each CDA a cell death severity score from 0 (no cell death) to 6
    (strong cell death). Diagnostic plots show whether new images resemble
    the images the models were trained on. The CDAs can be cropped from
    source images using bounding boxes recorded with 'CDALabeller'.
